    "location": "html-block:33",
    "text": "Overview",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:34",
    "text": "Our Bulletin 1408 PowerMonitor™ 1000 is a compact power monitor for load profiling, cost allocation, or energy control. Our monitor integrates with your existing energy monitoring systems to provide sub-metering. Our PLCs (PLC-5®, SLC®, ControlLogix® family) easily communicate with the PowerMonitor™ 1000 to use energy data in control systems.",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:35",
    "text": "Available in a compact size",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:36",
    "text": "Available EtherNet/IP™, Serial DF1, Modbus RTU, Modbus TCP communications",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:37",
    "text": "Includes integrated LCD display",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:38",
    "text": "Includes panel or DIN rail mounting",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:39",
    "text": "Provides wiring diagnostics",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:40",
    "text": "Includes time of use (On-Peak, Off-Peak)",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:41",
    "text": "Includes energy, min/max, status, and load factor logs",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:42",
    "text": "Offers ability to view data and configure through the integrated web page",
    "heading": "Allen-Bradley"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:43",
    "text": "Additional Information"
  },
  {
    "location": "html-block:44",
    "text": "Power Quality & Energy Management — Use this interactive tool to see how energy and power quality management can help you reduce costs and avoid unplanned downtime.",
    "heading": "Additional Information"
  },
